      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرْقَدَةٌ</span></b>  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُقَدْة</span> <i>of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُنْجُور</span> [meaning the
